#: ../modules/memoserv/memoserv.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is a utility allowing IRC users to send short messages to other IRC users, whether they are online at the time or not, or to channels(*). Both the "
"sender's nickname and the target nickname or channel must be registered in order to send a memo.\n"
"\n"
"%s's commands include:"
